  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DBP Consultancy and Marketing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DBP Dhaka had been approved a grant DKK.700.000 during 2014 in the frame of consultancy and marketing. The allocation was meant for carrying out studies on different sector or ideas. As a part of it, DBP organised a delegation on Green Growth in May 2014. In 2014 there were 2 DBP events and 1 Delegation of Danish companies. The funds had been used for consultant fees, venue, accommodation, print materials to support these events as well as for CSR and other consultancy and promotional activities. The funding has been completed.</narrative>
  </description>
